# Two env files, one per process that reads secrets. Never commit them.
#
#   cp .env.example agent/.env     → the Deep Agent (npx @langchain/langgraph-cli dev)
#   cp .env.example backend/.env   → the Copilot Runtime (Node)
#
# Each process ignores the variables meant for the other. The Vite frontend
# reads none of these and never sees a key.

# ── agent/.env — read by the LangGraph CLI (langgraph.json: "env": ".env") ──

# Required. The graph calls "openai:gpt-6-luna" (the Deep Agents Quickstart's
# model, unchanged). The Quickstart's "Configure your environment" step.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# ── backend/.env — read by `npm run dev` in backend/ ────────────────────────

# Required. Where the runtime's LangGraphAgent finds the graph: the port the
# Deep Agents Quickstart starts the agent on (8123). Read by the landing page's
# runtime code as process.env.LANGGRAPH_DEPLOYMENT_URL.
LANGGRAPH_DEPLOYMENT_URL=http://localhost:8123

# Optional. Passed through as the landing page's `langsmithApiKey`. Not needed
# for a local dev server; needed for a LangSmith-hosted deployment.
# LANGSMITH_API_KEY=

# Optional. Runtime port; the Vite proxy targets 8200, so change both together.
# PORT=8200

# Optional. CopilotKit Intelligence project key, for /api/copilotkit-threads
# only (Threads Drawer, Headless Threads), wired per
# https://docs.copilotkit.ai/vue/deepagents/intelligence/quickstart.
# Easiest: run the quickstart's CLI steps inside backend/ —
#   cd backend && npx copilotkit@latest login && npx copilotkit@latest project select
# Without it that runtime is plain SSE (no thread store). Server-side only.
# CPK_INTELLIGENCE_API_KEY=cpk-...

# Optional. The fixed local identity the Threads runtime gives every caller
# (the Intelligence quickstart's "fixed identity ... local, single-user demo").
# NOT authentication.
# APP_USER_ID=local-user

# Optional. MCP server for /generative-ui/mcp-apps; default is the page's own
# example URL, served by `npm run mcp:apps` in backend/.
# MCP_APPS_URL=http://localhost:3101/mcp

# Optional. Opt out of CopilotKit runtime telemetry.
# COPILOTKIT_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=true
